B.aII=s(["Counts are selectable model parts, including segments, groups and alternative references. They are not counts of unique whole organs.","Neither body reference is an exhaustive anatomy atlas. The female reference has partial musculoskeletal coverage.","Lymphatic references do not include the complete distributed lymph-vessel network.","Sensory detail includes a combined labyrinth, not separately segmented cochlear microanatomy.","Skin is modeled at body and organ scale, without complete follicle or sweat-gland microanatomy.","Detail scenes keep separate source coordinates and are not superimposed on the body references.","Per-structure teaching review metadata is missing. Automated/source checks do not establish medical accuracy or human subject-matter approval. Unknown anatomical IDs remain unreviewed."],t.s)
