B.bgH=new A.cj("settings-audio",null,B.at,"Open Settings from the menu. Background Music and Sound Effects have separate switches and volume sliders. Disabled sliders follow their switch. Quiet Music During Lessons lowers music while reading. Preferences are saved on this device.",B.aH,null,"Music and sound effects","",null,"")
B.bh0=new A.cj("settings-silent",null,B.at,"Tap or press a key in the app to allow browser audio. Enable Background Music and raise its volume for the five-track soundtrack. Enable Sound Effects and choose Test Sound to check feedback audio. Also check device volume, browser tab mute, and the selected output device. Web music needs its first online asset download before offline use. Visual feedback remains usable without sound.",B.aH,null,"Troubleshoot missing audio","",null,"")
