B.aqC=s(["11 protons remain; electrons decrease from 11 to 10.","12 protons remain; electrons decrease from 12 to 10.","17 protons remain; electrons increase from 17 to 18."],t.s)
B.bE1=new A.ap("An ion changes electrons, not element identity","comparison",B.aNk,B.aqC,"These common ion charges help predict simple ionic ratios: MgCl2 balances +2 with two \u22121 charges.",B.u,"","")
