B.bDC=new A.ap("Random motion mixes particles without changing their identities","comparison",B.aC9,B.aCC,"A conceptual gas-diffusion snapshot, not an exact timeline. Individual particles move in different directions; the net spreading reflects concentration differences. Motion continues after mixing.",B.u,"","g7-diffusion")
