B.bEn=new A.ap("A steady lift transfers energy without increasing speed","comparison",B.aCh,B.aDl,"Ideal constant-velocity segment with no other resisting force. Equal force arrows do not mean neither force transfers energy. This is a diagram, not an instruction to lift a heavy load.",B.u,"","g8-work")
