B.aVh=s(["Roots","Stem","Leaves","Flower","Fruit and seeds"],t.s)
B.b2w=s(["Anchor the plant and absorb water and minerals.","Supports the plant and carries water and food.","Use light, water and carbon dioxide to make food.","Helps a flowering plant produce seeds.","A fruit protects seeds; seeds contain young plants."],t.s)
