B.aFN=s(["Equal left and right forces cancel. Horizontal motion does not change.","A stronger right force than left force changes motion toward the right."],t.s)
B.bE9=new A.ap("Compare forces on the same block","comparison",B.aD8,B.aFN,"Arrow direction shows force direction; length compares strength. These are force arrows, not travel paths. Vertical forces are balanced and omitted.",B.u,"","forces")
